<title>ITALY: Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Italy - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>ITALY</p>
<p>Genoa, April 21 - port situation - one bulk carrier awaiting berth, average berthing delay one to two days. Savona - no vessels awaiting berths. La Spezia - no vessels awaiting normal berths, but one vessel awaiting special berth.</p>
</text>
